sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant L as RoadLogistics (Creator)
  participant T as Truck (Product)
  C->>L: planDelivery("cargo")
  L->>L: createTransport() (factory method)
  L->>T: new Truck()
  T-->>L: caminhão
  L->>T: deliver("cargo")
  T-->>L: "Entrega por terra..."
  L-->>C: resultado
